An attribute run after a lone plus leads a sublist at the content column

```
- a
+
{x}
  - c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul x="">
      <li>c</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
+
{x
y}
  - c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul x="" y="">
      <li>c</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
> - a
> +
> {x}
>   - c
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a
      <ul x="">
        <li>c</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```
